/**
 * Public Runway bucket share links.
 *
 * These are public "share" links generated by Runway (https://runway.team)
 * that let anyone with the link install a build without a Runway account.
 * They are not secrets, so they are committed here as the single source of
 * truth instead of being duplicated across GitHub Actions secrets/variables
 * or hardcoded inline in workflow YAML.
 *
 * Consumers:
 *   - scripts/slack-rc-notification.mjs      (RELEASE_CANDIDATES)
 *   - scripts/slack-nightly-notification.mjs (NIGHTLY_*)
 *
 * If Runway ever rotates one of these links, update it here only.
 */

